cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Dayanak"
abstract: >-
  Citation-safe MCP server for Turkish legal research and document drafting.
  It gives AI assistants access to Turkish case law (Yargıtay, Danıştay,
  Constitutional Court and others) and legislation without fabricated
  citations: decisions, dates, docket numbers and statutory articles are only
  quoted from verified full texts, and missing sources are reported as such.
authors:
